Are you looking forward to the new Ghostbusters movie? Then the following news will be very interesting, as it's connected both to this film and to Activision. You know what I'm talking about, right? Ghostbusters from Activision is a new and refreshing game project that will allow you to once again immerse yourself in a familiar universe and try to uncover new details about the lives and deeds of the Ghostbusters. However, this time, you'll have an unusual adventure, as you'll have to take on the role of ordinary rookies who must guard the base and captured ghosts while the main characters are out on the job. While this may not sound so promising, and many were expecting new adventures, the reality is much better.

The new Ghostbusters is a top-down arcade game that, while light and fun, still offers a wealth of interesting details. Despite the limited gameplay, you'll still be able to learn the fates of your favorite characters. The game is scheduled to release on July 15th for PC and modern gaming platforms PS4 and Xbox One. And that's when you'll be able to download Ghostbusters for free via torrent using our website.

Game features:
- you will be able to meet your favorite characters, who gave the game their appearance, their voices, and their individual mannerisms, in addition, the script itself was written by the creators of the film;
- this time the events of the adventure will take place two years after the second film, but don’t expect a boring story, the ghosts are back and now they are very serious;
- this time you will be able to feel like a real hunter who will be able to use the blaster for its intended purpose, catch ghosts in a beam and then actively place it in a trap;
- This time you will have to carefully study your enemy and try to correctly understand his weaknesses, only after that you will need to use all your equipment, which consists of 4 different sets and 8 types of weapons.

